      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 460,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 29 · AI Webinar Automation\nHandles webinar registrations: personalised confirmation, lead scoring from registration answers and sales alerts.\n\n**Trigger:** `POST /webhook/webinar-automation` (JSON body)\n\n**Setup**\n1. Edit the **Config** node (model, sheet URL, endpoints).\n2. Connect credentials: Gmail OAuth2, Google Sheets OAuth2, OpenAI API, Slack.\n3. Pick Slack channels / sheet tabs on the action nodes.\n4. Activate.\n\n**Sample payload:**\n```json\n{\n \"name\": \"Arjun\",\n \"email\": \"arjun@retailco.com\",\n \"company\": \"RetailCo\",\n \"role\": \"VP Operations\",\n \"challenge\": \"too many manual order workflows\"\n}\n```"
      }
